<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0632_T30PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Deep in Indigo Plateau is the Big\nLeague.\rThe best Hustlers in the country pull\nup there. And their egos. Big egos.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0632_T30PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There was a move I HAD to teach my\nhomie.\rSo I paid the Move Deleter to make it\nforget a HM. He charged me DOUBLE.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0632_T30PC0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">They say behind the Block is a secret\ncave for Block Bosses to train.\rIt’s a dragon gym. With no AC.</language>
	</row>
</body>
